{"schemaVersion":"kfc_portal_schema_v1","generatedAt":"2026-08-10T05:49:25.213674+00:00","type":"news","id":"news_d9aa51a7bff620403207","item":{"id":"news_d9aa51a7bff620403207","type":"news","title":"在美国医疗成本上升之际，星巴克停止为员工承保这些药物","sourceId":"timesofindia.indiatimes.com","status":"new","publishedAt":"2026-08-10T10:59:48","updatedAt":"2026-08-10T05:15:08.989534Z","summary":"星巴克将于10月起停止为员工承保GLP-1类减肥药物。这一决定反映了成本上升及企业在员工福利方面的更广泛趋势。GLP-1类药物最初用于治疗糖尿病，如今在肥胖治疗中广受欢迎。Allina Health和普华永道等其他公司也已调整其承保政策。然而，美国银行仍将GLP-1类药物承保视为对员工健康的重要投资。","articleId":"","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/as-companies-in-america-face-rising-health-costs-starbucks-ends-employee-benefits-coverage-for-these-medicines/articleshow/133078802.cms"}}